  "title": {
    "rendered": "Accessibility Statement"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"590\" class=\"elementor elementor-590\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2cb0ac4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2cb0ac4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32c3fe4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"32c3fe4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-793324c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"793324c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Accessibility Statement</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bb3ec6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7bb3ec6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Commitment</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57a222a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"57a222a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">LMH, operating as <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"http://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> , is committed to making <span data-inline-card=\"true\" data-card-url=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com\"><span class=\"loader-wrapper\"><a class=\"_1yt4x7n9 _2rko12b0 _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz1y58 _1rkwglyw _4cvxmr28 _19it1x13 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b1r31 _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehicw00 _1j5pglyw _1di629zg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" href=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\" data-testid=\"inline-card-resolved-view\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66\" data-testid=\"inline-card-icon-and-title\"><span class=\"_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw\">Home</span></span></a></span></span> accessible to as many people as reasonably possible, including people with disabilities. We strive to follow recognized best practices, such as the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA, where feasible.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b863512 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b863512\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Measures We Take</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ee01fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0ee01fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">To support accessibility, we aim to:<br />• Use clear headings, descriptive link text, and logical page structure<br />• Maintain sufficient color contrast between text and background where possible<br />• Provide alternative text for key images where appropriate<br />• Support keyboard navigation for important features<br />• Avoid relying solely on color to convey information<br />• Test the Website on modern browsers and devices</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b4fe2e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b4fe2e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ongoing Improvements</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af35f02 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"af35f02\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"608\">Accessibility is an ongoing process. We regularly review our Website and may make improvements over time as we update content, design, and code. We welcome feedback on how we can enhance accessibility.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4956b2a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4956b2a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Known Limitations</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4bda315 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4bda315\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"966\">Despite our efforts, certain areas of the Website may not yet be fully accessible, such as:<br />• Third-party plugins or embedded content that we do not control<br />• Older videos, documents, or media that may lack transcripts or captions</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1218\">If you encounter any difficulties, please let us know.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1276\">Feedback and Contact<br />If you experience any accessibility barriers or have suggestions for improvement, please contact us with:<br />• The URL of the page<br />• A description of the issue<br />• Your browser, device, and any assistive technologies used (if applicable)</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4978f8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c4978f8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contact:</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ce6d54 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2ce6d54\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1533\">• Email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a><br />• Alternate email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" href=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com</a></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1631\">We will do our best to respond and, where feasible, to provide an accessible alternative or remedy the issue.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1744\">Enforcement<br />Depending on your jurisdiction, you may also have the right to contact a governmental or regulatory body regarding accessibility or discrimination concerns.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fbab66a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"fbab66a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
    "protected": false
  },
